From: WhaleOS <whaleos-dev@navercorp.com>
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] lxc.py, images.py: CRAS audio passthrough (HIDL passthrough mode)

Enable CRAS audio in the Android container via HIDL passthrough mode.
audioserver (64-bit) dlopens audio.primary.cras.so directly; no separate
hwbinder HAL process is needed.

Changes:

1. generate_session_lxc_config(): on every container start, open CRAS
   socket permissions and bind-mount overlay files when the files exist:
   - Open /run/cras and its socket files to o+rwx/o+rw here (at session
     start, after the user has logged in) rather than in waydroid-container.conf
     pre-start. CRAS restarts on user login, which resets socket permissions to
     770 after the pre-start chmod has already run.
   - vendor/etc/vintf/manifest.xml: passthrough transport for audio so
     64-bit audioserver can dlopen the 64-bit CRAS HAL directly.
     The hwbinder audio service is 32-bit and cannot load a 64-bit .so.
   - vendor/etc/init/android.hardware.audio.service.rc: disables
     vendor.audio-hal (in passthrough mode audioserver owns the HAL;
     a competing hwbinder HAL service causes crash loops).
   - system/etc/init/audioserver.rc: removes vendor.audio-hal restart
     triggers, patches linkerconfig sphal->vndk shared_libs to include
     libfmq.so, libmedia_helper.so, libaudioutils.so (required for
     android.hardware.audio@4.0-impl.so to load from sphal namespace).
   - vendor/lib64/hw/audio.primary.waydroid.so: CRAS HAL binary.
   - var/run/cras/.cras_{socket,playback,capture}: individual socket
     files bound from host /run/cras/. Binding the whole directory
     causes a kernel oops in do_faccessat on kernel 5.15; binding
     individual files avoids it.
   All entries are guarded by os.path.exists() and use optional so
   missing files are silently skipped.

2. make_base_props(): set ro.hardware.audio.primary=waydroid when the
   CRAS HAL binary is present, telling audioserver to load
   audio.primary.waydroid.so instead of the default stub HAL.

3. images.py:make_prop(): also inject ro.hardware.audio.primary=waydroid
   at every container start so the property is always present even if
   waydroid was initialised before the HAL package was installed
   (make_base_props only runs at waydroid init / upgrade).

Note: ChromeOS host SELinux (SELINUXTYPE=arc, Enforcing) denies an
unprivileged caller's faccessat() on cras_socket objects. This patch
relies on the dedicated `whaleos_waydroid` SELinux domain (see
platform2/sepolicy/policy/chromeos/whaleos_waydroid.te) which is
granted cros_cras_client() so the container audioserver can connect
to /run/cras/.cras_socket through the LXC bind-mount set up below.
init.waydroid.rc also adds a property trigger to stop vendor.audio-hal
when ro.hardware.audio.primary=waydroid is set.

--- a/tools/helpers/lxc.py
+++ b/tools/helpers/lxc.py
@@ -207,6 +207,44 @@
     if os.path.exists(pulse_host_socket):
         make_entry(pulse_host_socket, pulse_container_socket[1:])

+    # WhaleOS: CRAS audio passthrough - open socket permissions and bind files.
+    # chmod here (at session start, after user login) because CRAS restarts on
+    # user login and resets socket permissions to 770 after the waydroid-container
+    # pre-start chmod has already run.
+    _cras_hal = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/system/lib64/hw/audio.primary.cras.so"
+    if os.path.exists(_cras_hal):
+        try:
+            os.chmod("/run/cras", 0o1777)
+        except OSError:
+            pass
+        for _sock in [".cras_socket", ".cras_playback", ".cras_capture"]:
+            try:
+                os.chmod("/run/cras/" + _sock, 0o666)
+            except OSError:
+                pass
+    _vendor_manifest = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/vendor/etc/vintf/manifest.xml"
+    if os.path.exists(_vendor_manifest):
+        make_entry(_vendor_manifest, "vendor/etc/vintf/manifest.xml",
+                   options="bind,create=file,optional 0 0")
+    _audio_hal_rc = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/vendor/etc/init/android.hardware.audio.service.rc"
+    if os.path.exists(_audio_hal_rc):
+        make_entry(_audio_hal_rc, "vendor/etc/init/android.hardware.audio.service.rc",
+                   options="bind,create=file,optional 0 0")
+    _audioserver_rc = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/system/etc/init/audioserver.rc"
+    if os.path.exists(_audioserver_rc):
+        make_entry(_audioserver_rc, "system/etc/init/audioserver.rc",
+                   options="bind,create=file,optional 0 0")
+    if os.path.exists(_cras_hal):
+        make_entry(_cras_hal, "vendor/lib64/hw/audio.primary.waydroid.so",
+                   options="bind,create=file,optional 0 0")
+    # Bind individual CRAS sockets as files. Binding the directory triggers
+    # a kernel oops in do_faccessat on kernel 5.15; individual file binds work.
+    for _cras_sock in [".cras_socket", ".cras_playback", ".cras_capture"]:
+        _sock_path = "/run/cras/" + _cras_sock
+        if os.path.exists(_sock_path):
+            make_entry(_sock_path, "var/run/cras/" + _cras_sock,
+                       options="bind,create=file,optional 0 0")
+
     if not make_entry(session["waydroid_data"], "data", options="rbind 0 0"):
         raise OSError("Failed to bind userdata")

@@ -255,6 +293,11 @@
     props.append("ro.adb.secure=0")
     props.append("ro.debuggable=1")

+    # WhaleOS: CRAS passthrough audio HAL
+    _cras_hal = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/system/lib64/hw/audio.primary.cras.so"
+    if os.path.exists(_cras_hal):
+        props.append("ro.hardware.audio.primary=waydroid")
+
     egl = tools.helpers.props.host_get(args, "ro.hardware.egl")
     dri, _ = tools.helpers.gpu.getDriNode(args)

--- a/tools/helpers/images.py
+++ b/tools/helpers/images.py
@@ -156,6 +156,14 @@
     dpi = cfg["lcd_density"]
     if dpi != "0":
         props.append("ro.sf.lcd_density=" + dpi)

+    # WhaleOS: inject CRAS audio HAL property at every container start so it
+    # is set even when waydroid was initialised before the HAL package was
+    # installed (make_base_props only writes waydroid_base.prop at init/upgrade).
+    _cras_hal = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/system/lib64/hw/audio.primary.cras.so"
